<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&dagger; The term &ldquo;new or revised financial accounting standard&rdquo;
refers to any update issued by the Financial Accounting Standards Board to its Accounting Standards Codification after April 5, 2012.&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

