    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><A HREF="ea175194ex5-2_clearmind.htm">Opinion of Greenberg Traurig, P.A., U.S. counsel to the registrant</A></FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">10.1</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD><A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1892500/000121390022057529/ea165399ex10-1_clearmind.htm"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Form of Indemnification Agreement (incorporated herein by reference to Exhibit 10.1 to the registrant&rsquo;s registration statement on Form F-1, as amended, filed with the SEC on September 20, 2022 (File No. 333-265900))</FONT></A></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
